// Distribution is a dividend / coupon run. The issuer creates one
// against a snapshot, funds it (transferring settlement_denom from
// their stablecoin balance into the module-controlled distribution
// pool), and holders pull-claim their pro-rata share.
//
//	per_unit_rate = total_amount * SCALE / snapshot.total_supply   (uint128 logic)
//	amount_for(holder) = floor(snapshot_balance * per_unit_rate / SCALE)
//
// SCALE = 1e12 to keep fractional precision for tiny per-unit
// amounts on large supplies.
